flowchart TD
    User[👤 User] --> Search[🔍 Search Bar<br/>Filter by Title/Artist/Album/Genre]
    Search --> Select[📋 Track Selection<br/>Dropdown from Filtered Results]
    Select --> Query[⚡ Recommendation Query<br/>User selects track]

    Query --> BallTree[🌳 Ball Tree Index<br/>Precomputed Nearest Neighbor Search]
    BallTree --> KNN[K-Nearest Neighbors<br/>Find 6 similar tracks]

    KNN --> HybridScore[⚖️ Hybrid Scoring<br/>70% Audio Similarity<br/>30% Popularity Weight]
    HybridScore --> Rank[📊 Ranking<br/>Sort by combined score]
    Rank --> Top5[🎵 Top 5 Recommendations]

    Top5 --> Display[📱 Display Results<br/>Track details + Spotify embeds]
    Display --> Spotify[🎧 Spotify Player<br/>30-second previews]

    Spotify --> User

    subgraph "Data Pipeline"
        CSV[📄 CSV Files] --> Load[📥 Data Loading]
        Load --> Clean[🧹 Data Cleaning]
        Clean --> Features[🎼 Feature Extraction<br/>9 audio features]
        Features --> Scale[📏 StandardScaler<br/>Normalize features]
        Scale --> Index[🏗️ Ball Tree Build<br/>One-time preprocessing]
    end

    Index -.-> BallTree

